{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12311950","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12311950","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1231195001:1":{"text":"전부 고기잡이 배들이야.","source_cn":"这些都是些捕鱼船。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x302601A730D0493E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1231195002:1":{"text":"먼바다는 안개와 바다 몬스터로 난리지만, 가까운 바다는 상대적으로 안전하지.","source_cn":"虽然远海全是大雾和海怪，但是近海处相比之下还是比较安全。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C657F2D03CF3A97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1231195003:1":{"text":"물론 위험하긴 하지만, 고작 그 정도로는 항구의 폭등하는 물고기 값 앞에서는 아무것도 아니야.","source_cn":"近海当然也有危险，但这种程度的风险也抵不住港口鱼价上涨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F18A73BD4900BFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1231195004:1":{"text":"수익을 내야 하니까. 요즘 근해에 고기잡이 배가 예전보다 많이 늘었어.","source_cn":"利润取东西哎，最近在近海的捕鱼船，甚至比之前还要多不少。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88DFE516E891C8F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:码头工人巴拿马":{"text":"부두 근로자 파나마","source":"码头工人巴拿马","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}